schema: "0.4"
id: scholar-10-learning-plan-dashboard
type: image
quality: high

# The Robot Learns — a terminal study CLI. Learning Plan Dashboard — the goal-tracking home
# for a multi-week plan (milestones, weekly metrics, adaptive pacing). Scholar's CLEAN-MINIMAL
# take in a LIGHT terminal (the deliberate contrast to cockpit's dense mission-control TUI).
# Theme tenets: light-native near-white canvas, single indigo accent, crisp 4px radius, thin
# visible gray borders (structure from lines), Inter labels + JetBrains Mono figures.
# Palette: canvas #fafafa, ink #111118, alt #f5f5f5, border #e0e0e0, indigo accent #6366F1.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a clean,
    minimal LIGHT terminal DASHBOARD — the goal-tracking home for a multi-week learning
    plan. This is Scholar's calm, airy, precise take: quiet stat tiles, a milestone tracker,
    an activity feed, held in a near-white terminal pane with one indigo signal. It is
    deliberately calm and minimal — the antithesis of a dense multi-panel mission-control
    cockpit. Near-white canvas (a light-mode terminal), NOT dark. Labels in a clean humanist
    sans (Inter); numbers, dates and keys in a matched monospace. One single indigo accent,
    no second saturated hue.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity mockup of a clean, minimal LIGHT terminal DASHBOARD — "The Robot
    Learns" — the learning-plan home for a stated goal ("AWS Solutions Architect in 10
    weeks"). One calm near-white terminal window fills the frame. This is a light-mode
    terminal (near-white canvas, dark ink), NOT a dark terminal and NOT a browser page, and
    deliberately calm and airy — not a busy mission-control cockpit.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (a title bar, a header band, a stat-tile row, then two columns):
    - TITLE BAR: minimal terminal chrome — three small dots and a mono title
      "the-robot-learns — /learning-plan".
    - HEADER BAND: the plan goal in medium-weight sans beside an EXPERTISE LEVEL BADGE (a
      small bordered chip "Cloud · Intermediate to Advanced") and a quiet mono "week 4 of 10".
    - STAT-TILE ROW: four KB STAT TILES, each a bordered near-white card (4px, thin gray
      border) — a big mono figure over a muted sans label: "Retention 86%", "Cards due 12",
      "Streak 9d", "Quizzes 3". Airy, evenly spaced, with a single indigo underline on the
      active tile.
    - LEFT COLUMN (dominant): a MILESTONE TRACKER — a vertical list of plan milestones, each
      with a checkbox state (a few done with an indigo check, the current one marked by a 2px
      indigo left rail, the rest muted/upcoming) and a thin per-milestone indigo progress bar
      on a recessed gray track.
    - RIGHT COLUMN (slim): a SESSION LOG activity feed — recent activity as short mono
      timestamped lines "reviewed 40 cards", "graded project: passed", "quiz: 8/10", quiet
      and muted, newest on top.

    A faint mono status line: "plan adapts to your quiz + flashcard performance · weekly
    summary sent sunday".

    PALETTE & TYPE: near-white canvas with a faint cool-gray alt surface for the tiles and
    tracks; deep near-black figures and headings, muted gray labels and meta; a single
    saturated indigo as the only color — milestone checks, the current rail, the progress
    fills, the active-tile underline. No second saturated hue. Headings and labels in a clean
    humanist sans; figures, dates, streaks and keys in a matched monospace.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: crisp small 4px rounded corners on the stat tiles and bars; thin visible
    cool-gray borders separate the tiles and columns (structure from lines, not shadow);
    flat, calm layering, no elevation beyond a single faint shadow if any. No gradients, no
    glow, no texture.

    MOOD: precise, calm, trustworthy — a clean, quiet overview of steady progress; minimal
    and legible, the opposite of a busy cockpit.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, browser chrome, address bar, browser tabs, web page, dark terminal, dark mode, black background, neon glow, gradient background, busy multi-panel cockpit, dense mission-control, multiple accent colors"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the Learning Plan Dashboard: a goal header with an expertise-level badge, a row of KB stat tiles, a milestone/progress tracker column, and a session-log activity feed — inside one terminal pane"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Light-native near-white terminal canvas, a single indigo accent (no second saturated hue), crisp 4px radius, thin visible gray borders, calm sans labels + mono figures — a clean minimal dashboard, deliberately NOT a busy multi-color cockpit and NOT a dark terminal"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Airy stat row over a milestone column plus a slim activity feed, clear hierarchy, plausible real-product terminal layout"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "dark terminal / dark mode instead of a light near-white terminal"
    - "browser chrome, tabs, or address bar instead of a terminal window"
    - "busy multi-panel cockpit or more than one saturated accent hue"

tags: [scholar, therobotlearns.com, screen-mockup, terminal, hero]
